@ifnottex
@node Top
@top Org-Ex

Org-Ex embeds interactive widgets---GTK controls, web views, buffer
windows, and code evaluation results---directly inside Org mode buffers.
Widgets are declared with special blocks, bound reactively to document
properties, and exported cleanly to HTML, PDF, and plain text.
@end ifnottex

