set (a @code{user-ptr} wrapping a @code{GPtrArray}).

@item org-ex-ink-strokes-to-string STROKES
Serialise a stroke set to its block-body string form.

@item org-ex-ink-strokes-to-svg STROKES WIDTH HEIGHT
Render a stroke set to an SVG string.

@item org-ex-ink-strokes-empty
Return a fresh empty stroke set.

@item org-ex-ink-strokes-count STROKES
Return the number of strokes in a stroke set.

@item org-ex-ink-capture &optional INITIAL WIDTH HEIGHT COLOUR BASE-WIDTH SIDE-BUTTON-ERASES
Open the modal ink capture window.  Returns @code{(STROKES . CANCELLED)}
where STROKES is a fresh user-ptr (nil when cancelled) and CANCELLED
is t on Esc / window close.
@end table

